    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bWarning\u203b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The update has been postponed indefinitely. We apologize for the inconvenience. We will also do our best to assist with refunds for those who have already made a purchase.<br><br>This game tells the story of <strong>Little Witch Nella</strong>, an apprentice to the witch of the western forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn skills such as magic and alchemy, hunt monsters, and build relationships with the people of the village and kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell crops through farming, catch fish by fishing, and even receive rewards from feeding the cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the story of Little Witch Nella through a variety of activities.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bWarning\u203b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The update has been postponed indefinitely. We apologize for the inconvenience. We will also do our best to assist with refunds for those who have already made a purchase.<br><br>This game tells the story of <strong>Little Witch Nella</strong>, an apprentice to the witch of the western forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn skills such as magic and alchemy, hunt monsters, and build relationships with the people of the village and kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell crops through farming, catch fish by fishing, and even receive rewards from feeding the cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the story of Little Witch Nella through a variety of activities.</p>",
    "short_description": "Lead the story of Nella, a little witch and apprentice to the witch of the western forest. Learn various skills and magic, and interact with people through activities like farming and fishing!",
